-- N5 example sentences, batch 5: the topics that were blocked.
--
-- Six of these ten could not be written at all until the tokeniser learned to
-- read a grammar pattern as one unit — 〜てもいい, 〜なければなりません, けど,
-- 〜つもり, 〜でしょう and こそあど each shredded into the kana they are spelled
-- with, and a sentence teaching a pattern necessarily contains it. The blocked
-- list is empty now.
--
-- Additive, idempotent, safe on a live database.

